 and a truly immersive residential experience creates an environment where players grow both as athletes and as individuals. Whether your goal is to improve technical ability, boost soccer IQ, or experience what it’s like to train in a top-tier college soccer environment, the Nike Soccer Camp at Oregon State University delivers a fun, competitive, and unforgettable summer camp experience.','$449','day','all','open','','','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-oregon-state-university#session-80989-1215655',0,0,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T14:59:55.656Z','support@parentcoachdesk.com','2026-05-09 15:11:25','Bulk approve ussportscamps harvester run',0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'camp',NULL,NULL,'medium','ussportscamps.com',NULL,'live','2026-05-09T14:59:57.114Z',200,0,0,NULL,NULL);
