campers will develop a love for soccer, and enjoy participating with passionate coaches and new friends. In addition to developing soccer players, we enjoy pouring into the kids with an emphasis on teamwork and how to treat others. Our staff consists of highly qualified coaches, but we also have members of our staff who are local school principals, teachers, and college professors. It makes for a well-rounded group that has expertise in working with children. This makes all aspects of the camp, from registration and check-in process, making the campers feel safe and comfortable, and emphasizing life skills."','$299','day','all','open','','','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-furman-university#session-79589-1213283',0,0,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T15:00:14.276Z','support@parentcoachdesk.com','2026-05-09 15:11:25','Bulk approve ussportscamps harvester run',0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'camp',NULL,NULL,'medium','ussportscamps.com',NULL,'live','2026-05-09T15:00:14.499Z',200,0,0,NULL,NULL);
