, HUB Sports delivers a memorable, professionally run soccer camp experience that families return to year after year. If you’re looking for a fun, safe, and exciting way to spend the summer in Scottsdale, this indoor Nike Soccer Camp is the perfect place to play, learn, and fall in love with the game.','$399','day','all','open','','','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-indoor-soccer-camp-hub-sports-rancho-solano#session-82835-1218211',0,0,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T15:00:18.372Z','support@parentcoachdesk.com','2026-05-09 15:11:25','Bulk approve ussportscamps harvester run',0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'camp',NULL,NULL,'medium','ussportscamps.com',NULL,'live','2026-05-09T15:00:18.567Z',200,0,0,NULL,NULL);
