 designed to inspire creativity, sharpen decision‑making, and build a true love for the sport. Combined with Cabrillo College’s premium training facilities and an upbeat, supportive camp culture, this program offers one of the most exciting and sought‑after youth soccer experiences in the Santa Cruz and Monterey Bay region. Join us this summer and experience why the Nike Soccer Camp at Cabrillo College continues to sell out every year—train with elite coaches, develop your game, and enjoy an unforgettable week of soccer excellence!','$325','day','all','open','','','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-cabrillo-college#session-80562-1215038',0,0,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T15:00:30.653Z','support@parentcoachdesk.com','2026-05-09 15:11:25','Bulk approve ussportscamps harvester run',0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'camp',NULL,NULL,'medium','ussportscamps.com',NULL,'live','2026-05-09T15:00:30.981Z',200,0,0,NULL,NULL);
