ividual attention. Campers will develop new techniques, strengthen fundamentals, improve decision-making, and build confidence through dynamic drills and competitive play. “At LA Soccer Camps, our goal is simple, we want kids from all backgrounds to have fun, play the game, and continue developing their skills. Each week we focus on one core fundamental each day, like dribbling, turning, passing, receiving, and shooting, so players can really lock in and build confidence. More than anything, we want kids to leave camp smiling, proud of what they learned, and excited to come back the next day.” - Chris Bonawandt, Camp Director','$315','day','all','open','','','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-sofive-rancho-cucamonga#session-82120-1217228',0,0,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T15:00:42.450Z','support@parentcoachdesk.com','2026-05-09 15:11:25','Bulk approve ussportscamps harvester run',0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'camp',NULL,NULL,'medium','ussportscamps.com',NULL,'live','2026-05-09T15:00:42.890Z',200,0,0,NULL,NULL);
