sal sessions for full‑day campers. With elite coaching, a premier campus setting, and the proven Nike Soccer Camps experience, this is one of the most exciting soccer camps in Las Vegas. Train. Play. Compete. And take your game to the next level this summer!','$155','day','all','open','','','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-las-vegas-nv#session-80429-1215077',0,0,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T15:01:00.480Z','support@parentcoachdesk.com','2026-05-09 15:11:25','Bulk approve ussportscamps harvester run',0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'camp',NULL,NULL,'medium','ussportscamps.com',NULL,'live','2026-05-09T15:01:00.764Z',200,0,0,NULL,NULL);
