to improve their soccer skills, make new friends, or enjoy an exciting week outdoors, the Nike Soccer Camp at UW‑Parkside offers an incredible experience from the opening whistle to the final celebration. Hear from Head Coach Brittany Nikolic: "Our coaching staff is made up of current college coaches and college players. We love to teach technique and game concepts so the kids build confidence and in turn have a great time. We strongly believe in teamwork and respect and know that through sport these kids are developing important life skills."','$245','day','all','open','','','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-uw-parkside#session-79297-1212839',0,0,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T15:01:06.864Z','support@parentcoachdesk.com','2026-05-09 15:11:25','Bulk approve ussportscamps harvester run',0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'camp',NULL,NULL,'medium','ussportscamps.com',NULL,'live','2026-05-09T15:01:07.291Z',200,0,0,NULL,NULL);
