lege athlete. From dorm living to training on campus fields, players gain a firsthand understanding of what it takes to compete at the collegiate level while building independence, friendships, and lasting summer memories. Sure to be a summer highlight, this camp offers a unique and exciting opportunity for aspiring soccer players ages 10–16 to train in a FUN, engaging, and collegiate-level setting. Throughout the week, campers will develop new skills, refine techniques, expand their game knowledge, and enjoy the game alongside players from across the region.','$554','day','all','open','','','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-at-the-university-of-oklahoma#session-82750-1218097',0,0,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T15:01:41.801Z','support@parentcoachdesk.com','2026-05-09 15:11:25','Bulk approve ussportscamps harvester run',0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'camp',NULL,NULL,'medium','ussportscamps.com',NULL,'live','2026-05-09T15:01:41.999Z',200,0,0,NULL,NULL);
