amp (previously held at Cate School) are now unified under one vision, creating a stronger, more impactful camp for every player. The camp is led by Ben Maxwell of Player ONE Performance, Northern California’s premier club‑neutral training program since 2017 and the #1 Nike Soccer Camp Director in the U.S. (2026). Ben brings proven leadership and continuity from both programs, delivering a player‑focused training experience built on elite standards, high energy, and attention to detail. Campers follow a professionally designed curriculum emphasizing technical development, intelligent movement, goal‑scoring, game awareness, and mental preparation, leaving camp more confident, sharper, and ready to compete at the next level. Whether players are looking to elevate their performance, build confidence, or train alongside highly motivated peers, the overnight Nike Soccer Camp at Westmont College offers a summer experience that is both development‑driven and truly memorable.','$959','day','all','open','','','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-westmont-college-santa-barbara#session-81302-1216150',0,0,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T15:01:54.902Z','support@parentcoachdesk.com','2026-05-09 15:11:25','Bulk approve ussportscamps harvester run',0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'camp',NULL,NULL,'medium','ussportscamps.com',NULL,'live','2026-05-09T15:01:56.135Z',200,0,0,NULL,NULL);
