ld confidence, and make new friends. Hear from NIU Head Coach and Camp Director Michael O''Neil: "Our camp is built around the belief that young players learn best when they feel supported, challenged, and excited to be on the field. Through positive coaching, fun and engaging activities, and age-appropriate skill development, players will build confidence, improve their soccer fundamentals, learn teamwork and sportsmanship, and develop a lasting love for the game in a safe and encouraging environment."','$335','day','all','open','','','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-st-charles-il#session-82308-1217504',0,0,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T15:02:10.341Z','support@parentcoachdesk.com','2026-05-09 15:11:25','Bulk approve ussportscamps harvester run',0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'camp',NULL,NULL,'medium','ussportscamps.com',NULL,'live','2026-05-09T15:02:10.544Z',200,0,0,NULL,NULL);
