sh. Whether players are refining fundamentals or preparing for competitive play, they’ll experience meaningful progression throughout the week. With top‑tier coaching, a world‑class athletic facility, and the trademark energy of Prol Level Training and Nike Soccer Camps, this program delivers one of the best soccer training experiences in New Jersey. "Most camps focus on activity, we focus on development. At Total Turf, every rep has purpose, every player is challenged, and every session is designed to build real confidence through preparation. This isn’t about just showing up, it’s about leaving better than you arrived." - Sean Matteo, Camp Director','$285','day','all','open','','','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-total-turf-experience-pitman-nj#session-80873-1215462',0,0,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T15:02:39.805Z','support@parentcoachdesk.com','2026-05-09 15:11:25','Bulk approve ussportscamps harvester run',0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'camp',NULL,NULL,'medium','ussportscamps.com',NULL,'live','2026-05-09T15:02:41.462Z',200,0,0,NULL,NULL);
