cer Camp at Winsor School – Boston!','$499','day','all','open','','','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-winsor-school#session-79328-1212894',0,0,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T15:03:33.334Z','support@parentcoachdesk.com','2026-05-09 15:11:25','Bulk approve ussportscamps harvester run',0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'camp',NULL,NULL,'medium','ussportscamps.com',NULL,'live','2026-05-09T15:03:34.878Z',200,0,0,NULL,NULL);
