es, develop new skills, and take your game to the next level. Don’t miss this opportunity to elevate your soccer journey, register today! This camp SOLD OUT in 2025, so register early to avoid disappointment!','$230','day','all','open','','','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-back-mountain-surf-misericordia-university-pa#session-84889-1221016',0,0,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T15:05:24.602Z','support@parentcoachdesk.com','2026-05-09 15:11:25','Bulk approve ussportscamps harvester run',0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'camp',NULL,NULL,'medium','ussportscamps.com',NULL,'live','2026-05-09T15:05:25.313Z',200,0,0,NULL,NULL);
