n, and nearby portable restrooms ensure comfort and convenience for all. Join us for a week filled with new friends, inspiring coaches, and unforgettable memories, all while taking your game to the next level!','$359','day','all','open','','','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-haverhill-ma#session-84107-1219945',0,0,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T15:05:31.246Z','support@parentcoachdesk.com','2026-05-09 15:11:25','Bulk approve ussportscamps harvester run',0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'camp',NULL,NULL,'medium','ussportscamps.com',NULL,'live','2026-05-09T15:05:31.529Z',200,0,0,NULL,NULL);
