nd supportive environment. With personalized coaching, engaging drills, and an emphasis on both fun and progress, the Nike Boys Soccer Camp at Fairfield University delivers the ultimate summer soccer experience where every player can grow, succeed, and fall in love with the game.','$389','day','all','open','','','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-boys-soccer-camp-fairfield-university-connecticut#session-84001-1219793',0,0,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T15:05:36.729Z','support@parentcoachdesk.com','2026-05-09 15:11:25','Bulk approve ussportscamps harvester run',0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'camp',NULL,NULL,'medium','ussportscamps.com',NULL,'live','2026-05-09T15:05:38.502Z',200,0,0,NULL,NULL);
