, the camp features an extended curriculum that builds on technical foundations, introduces more advanced concepts, and helps prepare players for higher levels of play, all while maintaining the fun, supportive SoccerSidekicks culture. Whether it’s a child’s very first kick or the next step in their soccer journey, every aspect of the camp is thoughtfully designed to help players grow, thrive, and leave the field eager to come back. Join us this summer at Georgian Hills Park for a joy‑filled, development‑centered soccer experience where every player learns, grows, and leaves with newfound confidence and excitement for the beautiful game!','$250','day','all','open','','','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-brookhaven-atlanta#session-81712-1216692',0,0,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T15:05:52.719Z','support@parentcoachdesk.com','2026-05-09 15:11:25','Bulk approve ussportscamps harvester run',0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'camp',NULL,NULL,'medium','ussportscamps.com',NULL,'live','2026-05-09T15:05:54.682Z',200,0,0,NULL,NULL);
