tive, competitive, and energetic environment designed to boost confidence, sharpen soccer IQ, and inspire growth both on and off the field. Throughout the week, players will take part in fast‑paced drills, position‑specific instruction, skill‑enhancement sessions, small‑sided games, and full‑field activities that encourage creativity, quick decision‑making, and teamwork. Training on Shippensburg University’s premier facilities gives athletes an inspiring collegiate setting where they can challenge themselves, make new friends, and experience what it feels like to train like a college Roadrunner. With elite coaching, exceptional fields, and a curriculum built to elevate young players of all abilities, this camp delivers one of the most exciting youth soccer experiences in Shippensburg, Franklin County, and the wider Central Pennsylvania region.','$230','day','all','open','','','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-shippensburg-university#session-81108-1215854',0,0,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T15:08:44.389Z','support@parentcoachdesk.com','2026-05-09 15:11:25','Bulk approve ussportscamps harvester run',0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'camp',NULL,NULL,'medium','ussportscamps.com',NULL,'live','2026-05-09T15:08:45.977Z',200,0,0,NULL,NULL);
