ayers to build confidence, make new friends, and have fun playing the game they love!','$299','day','all','open','','','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-next-star-howard-university-washington-dc#session-79267-1212781',0,0,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T15:10:04.716Z','support@parentcoachdesk.com','2026-05-09 15:11:25','Bulk approve ussportscamps harvester run',0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'camp',NULL,NULL,'medium','ussportscamps.com',NULL,'live','2026-05-09T15:10:06.481Z',200,0,0,NULL,NULL);
