ing campers the opportunity to learn and compete in an authentic collegiate soccer environment. Hear from Head Women''s Soccer Coach &amp; Camp Director Michelle Rick: "Our goal is simple... create a fun, positive environment where kids can learn the game, play, and enjoy being on the field with their friends. This camp is perfect for young players of all levels who want to stay active, have fun, and improve their soccer skills over the summer. Whether new to the game or already playing, campers will enjoy a supportive environment focused on learning, playing, and enjoying the game with others."','$255','day','all','open','','','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/girls-soccer-camp-robert-morris-university#session-83091-1218555',0,0,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T15:10:20.275Z','support@parentcoachdesk.com','2026-05-09 15:11:25','Bulk approve ussportscamps harvester run',0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'camp',NULL,NULL,'medium','ussportscamps.com',NULL,'live','2026-05-09T15:10:21.935Z',200,0,0,NULL,NULL);
