e contact us if you have questions about enrollment information.','$389','day','all','open','','','https://www.ussportscamps.com/basketball/nike/nike-basketball-camp-winsor-school#session-85001-1221177',0,0,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T15:27:22.556Z','support@parentcoachdesk.com','2026-05-09 18:36:46','Bulk approve ussportscamps run',0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'camp',NULL,NULL,'medium','ussportscamps.com',NULL,'live','2026-05-09T15:27:22.803Z',200,0,0,NULL,NULL);
