atch to refine your strategy and improve your performance. Both programs offer Overnight, Extended Day, and Full Day options for players ages 8-18, providing flexibility to suit every camper''s needs. If your campers is a beginner or intermediate level player, please visit: Nike Tennis Camp at Mount Holyoke - All Skills Program This Camp must comply with the regulations of the Massachusetts Department of Public Health and be licensed by the local Board of Health. Parents/Guardians will have the right to review background checks, healthcare and discipline policies, and grievance procedures upon request.','$909','day','all','open','','','https://www.ussportscamps.com/tennis/nike/tournament-challenge-camp-massachusetts#session-80316-1214693',0,0,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T15:36:15.097Z','support@parentcoachdesk.com','2026-05-09 18:36:46','Bulk approve ussportscamps run',0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'camp',NULL,NULL,'medium','ussportscamps.com',NULL,'live','2026-05-09T15:36:15.490Z',200,0,0,NULL,NULL);
