seminars, and more. Transportation Campers may be transported by bus to a local athletic facility for training. The camp plans to use a mix of the East High School Baseball Field and Westminster University’s Dumke Field. The Nike Baseball Camp in Salt Lake City is open to any and all entrants and limited only by number, age and gender. This year, we will not be utilizing University of Utah and all campers and staff will be housed at Westminster University. Athletic facilities and coaches are subject to change. The camp is not owned, sponsored, controlled or endorsed by Westminster University.','$529','day','all','open','','','https://www.ussportscamps.com/baseball/nike/baseball-camp-westminster-university',0,0,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T18:32:13.487Z','support@parentcoachdesk.com','2026-05-09 18:36:46','Bulk approve ussportscamps run',0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'camp',NULL,NULL,'medium','ussportscamps.com',NULL,'live','2026-05-09T18:32:15.365Z',200,0,0,NULL,NULL);
