s 9:00am-4:00pm each day and includes daytime training only. Campers can bring their own lunch or purchase on campus. The day camp program is open to boys ages 8-17. Nike Sports Camp Experience At University of Denver, Nike Sports Camps offers a unique experience with many sports (Baseball, Cross Country, Football, Golf, Softball, and Tennis) operating simultaneously. During the day, the athletes receive sport-specific coaching within their sport focus. In the evening, overnight campers across all sports come together for a special camp-wide experience which includes fun field games, educational seminars, and more. Baseball Complex/Transportation Information The camp will likely utilize the Denver Christian School Baseball Field (as it has in the past) for daily training. Campers and staff are transported by bus to and from the off-campus facilities for training each day. The 2026 athletic facilities will be confirmed in the spring. The Nike Baseball Camp at University of Denver is open to any and all entrants and limited only by number, age and gender. Athletic facilities and coaches are subject to change. The camp is not owned, sponsored, controlled or endorsed by University of Denver.','$639','day','all','open','','','https://www.ussportscamps.com/baseball/nike/nike-baseball-camp-university-of-denver',0,0,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T18:32:15.996Z','support@parentcoachdesk.com','2026-05-09 18:36:46','Bulk approve ussportscamps run',0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'camp',NULL,NULL,'medium','ussportscamps.com',NULL,'live','2026-05-09T18:32:18.245Z',200,0,0,NULL,NULL);
