ains. The campus has large, nice dorms built in 2015 and more expansive athletic facilities for training and evening activities. Day Camp (9:00am – 4:00pm) Nike Baseball Camps also offers a day camp program for athletes who do not wish to stay overnight. The day camp program runs 9:00am-4:00pm each day and includes daytime training only. Campers can bring their own lunch or purchase on campus. The day camp program is open to boys ages 8-17. Nike Sports Camp Experience Nike Sports Camps offers a unique experience in Bend with many sports - Baseball, Cross Country, Golf (Coming Soon!), Soccer, Softball, Tennis, and Track &amp; Field - operating simultaneously. During the day, the athletes receive sport-specific coaching within their sport focus. In the evening, overnight campers across all sports come together for a special camp-wide experience which includes fun field games, educational seminars, and more. Baseball Complex/Transportation Information The camp will likely utilize the Big Sky Park Baseball Fields or Summit High School (as it has in the past) for daily training. Campers and staff are transported by bus to and from the off-campus facilities for training each day. The 2026 athletic facilities will be confirmed in the spring. The Nike Baseball Camp in Bend is open to any and all entrants and limited only by number, age and gender. Athletic facilities and coaches are subject to change. The camp is not owned, sponsored, controlled or endorsed by Central Oregon Community College.','$569','day','all','open','','','https://www.ussportscamps.com/baseball/nike/nike-baseball-camp-bend',0,0,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T18:32:20.682Z','support@parentcoachdesk.com','2026-05-09 18:36:46','Bulk approve ussportscamps run',0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'camp',NULL,NULL,'medium','ussportscamps.com',NULL,'live','2026-05-09T18:32:22.540Z',200,0,0,NULL,NULL);
