ty to be instructed by players and coaches from the Birmingham Bloomfield Beavers, Eastside Diamond Hoppers, Utica Unicorns, and the Westside Woolly Mammoths. Sign up today!','$325','day','all','open','','','https://www.ussportscamps.com/baseball/nike/nike-baseball-camp-united-states-professional-baseball-league',0,0,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T18:33:47.649Z','support@parentcoachdesk.com','2026-05-09 18:36:46','Bulk approve ussportscamps run',0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'camp',NULL,NULL,'medium','ussportscamps.com',NULL,'live','2026-05-09T18:33:47.953Z',200,0,0,NULL,NULL);
