ials: “The coaches at SSC were the best!” “This SSC camp was organized and directed in a fantastic way.”','$359','day','all','open','','','https://www.ussportscamps.com/baseball/nike/baseball-camp-sacramento',0,0,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T18:34:09.795Z','support@parentcoachdesk.com','2026-05-09 18:36:46','Bulk approve ussportscamps run',0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'camp',NULL,NULL,'medium','ussportscamps.com',NULL,'live','2026-05-09T18:34:10.384Z',200,0,0,NULL,NULL);
