, and two SCIAC Postseason Tournament Championships (2015 and 2025). Winterburn has also developed numerous standout players, coaching six SCIAC Players or Pitchers of the Year—all of whom earned All-America honors—and producing 43 All-West Region selections and 9 total All-Americans.','$429','day','all','open','','','https://www.ussportscamps.com/baseball/nike/nike-baseball-camp-university-of-la-verne-1',0,0,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T18:34:15.219Z','support@parentcoachdesk.com','2026-05-09 18:36:46','Bulk approve ussportscamps run',0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'camp',NULL,NULL,'medium','ussportscamps.com',NULL,'live','2026-05-09T18:34:15.464Z',200,0,0,NULL,NULL);
