chnology. With just 50 campers per week, athletes receive extensive one-on-one instruction and small-group coaching from experienced professional baseball coaches and trainers. Campers can expect a well-rounded experience that blends advanced skill development, competitive gameplay, and a positive, high-energy atmosphere—all built to help players grow their confidence, sharpen their skills, and enjoy every day at camp.','$399','day','all','open','','','https://www.ussportscamps.com/baseball/nike/nike-baseball-camp-on-deck-prince-georges-county',0,0,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T18:34:56.072Z','support@parentcoachdesk.com','2026-05-09 18:36:46','Bulk approve ussportscamps run',0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'camp',NULL,NULL,'medium','ussportscamps.com',NULL,'live','2026-05-09T18:34:57.685Z',200,0,0,NULL,NULL);
