to skill development, campers will take part in games, competitions, and fun challenge-based activities designed to reinforce teamwork, toughness, and a competitive spirit. Coaches will emphasize situational awareness, smart decision-making, and competing with the right attitude while creating an energetic and supportive atmosphere. The Nike Baseball Camp at Union University is built to help players grow both as athletes and teammates. Whether your child is just beginning their baseball journey or looking to sharpen their skills, this camp provides a fun and encouraging environment where players can improve, build confidence, and develop a passion for the game','$359','day','all','open','','','https://www.ussportscamps.com/baseball/nike/baseball-camp-union-university',0,0,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T18:41:43.866Z','support@parentcoachdesk.com','2026-05-09 18:51:04','Bulk approve ussportscamps full sweep',0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'camp',NULL,NULL,'medium','ussportscamps.com',NULL,'live','2026-05-09T18:41:45.330Z',200,0,0,NULL,NULL);
