ts, Wellness, and Recreation. He was previously the New York Area Director for the National Pitching Association. Instructors will utilize New York Empire Baseball''s proprietary Player Development Platform along with Blast Motion Bat Sensors and high-speed video analysis, among other technologies, to measure, assess, and define unique development programs for every player. This Camp will be rain or shine - as in the event of rain, Camp will move indoors to New York Empire Baseball''s High-Tech indoor home, The Arena. Players will begin their week-long experience with a complete Assessment and Baseline Hitting &amp; Pitching analysis before receiving their personalized Camp training program. All players will then engage in 5 days of small group sessions in Hitting, Throwing, Infielding, Outfielding, Baserunning, and Game Situations. Each day will focus on healthy athletic development and skill acquisition in a fun &amp; engaging environment that will also teach the mental/emotional approach needed to eliminate performance anxiety and fear of failure. Players will develop skills that scale, and receive an individualized post-Camp training routine to continue their own development.','$1269','day','all','open','','','https://www.ussportscamps.com/baseball/nike/nike-baseball-camp-central-park',0,0,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T18:42:27.898Z','support@parentcoachdesk.com','2026-05-09 18:51:04','Bulk approve ussportscamps full sweep',0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'camp',NULL,NULL,'medium','ussportscamps.com',NULL,'live','2026-05-09T18:42:29.504Z',200,0,0,NULL,NULL);
