rsity delivers a meaningful college‑style training experience that helps players grow on and off the field, equipping them with skills, motivation, and memories that carry well beyond the summer.','$439-$739','day','all','open','','','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-girls-soccer-camp-southeastern-university',0,0,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T20:19:27.486Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'camp',NULL,NULL,'medium','ussportscamps.com',NULL,'live','2026-05-09T20:19:29.004Z',200,1,0,NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "camps" ("id","slug","name","sport","age_min","age_max","start_date","end_date","address","city","state","zip","latitude","longitude","description","price_text","day_or_overnight","skill_level","spots_status","contact_email","contact_phone","website_url","lunch_included","aftercare_available","status","submitted_by_email","submitted_at","reviewed_by","reviewed_at","review_notes","verified","hero_photo_key","is_claimed","claimed_by_email","claim_paid_until","logo_key","gallery_keys","registration_url","last_edited_at","last_edited_by","program_type","registration_deadline","schedule_text","confidence","source_domain","reject_reason_code","url_health_status","url_last_checked_at","url_last_status_code","awaiting_review","featured","featured_order","featured_until") VALUES('bf2d6990-7416-4c86-ba35-020fc00e036e','nike-girls-soccer-camp-at-mcdaniel-college-player-development-july-16-19-2026','Nike Girls Soccer Camp at McDaniel College - Player Development (July 16–19, 2026)','soccer',10,13,'2026-07-16','2026-07-19','2 College Hill','Westminster','MD','21157',39.5851682,-77.0037276,'The Nike Girls Soccer Camp at McDaniel College in Westminster, Maryland offers an exceptional summer soccer experience set on a picturesque and welcoming collegiate campus. A three‑time sellout, this highly regarded camp provides young female athletes with the opportunity to train, compete, and live like college players in an environment designed to inspire growth, confidence, and independence. Campers benefit from daily training sessions on McDaniel’s excellent athletic facilities while experiencing college life through extended‑day and overnight options. The overnight experience allows players to fully immerse themselves in the collegiate setting, living in residence halls, participating in structured evening activities, and forming meaningful connections with teammates both on and off the field. The camp is led by Camp Director Sandy Lagana Bly, a respected leader in youth development, former collegiate head coach, and current Associate Director of Athletics at McDaniel College. Alongside Women’s Head Coach Michael Scott, the program features a seasoned staff of collegiate coaches, creating one of the strongest camp coaching lineups in the region. This elite staff delivers high‑quality technical and tactical instruction rooted in collegiate standards, while providing campers with an unmatched college soccer and student‑athlete experience. Designed for players of all experience levels, this girls‑only camp blends competitive training with a positive, empowering atmosphere that encourages leadership, resilience, and self‑belief. With its outstanding facilities, supportive coaching, and true college‑style immersion, the Nike Girls Soccer Camp at McDaniel College continues to be a summer highlight, creating lasting memories while helping players prepare for their next level, both in soccer and in life. “Our camp provides a personal experience for every camper. Our coaches and counselors work hard to connect with each player and create an environment where learning and fun go hand in hand. Older players also have the opportunity to expand their soccer knowledge by learning directly from college coaches as they prepare for their upcoming high school season.” — Sandy Lagana Bly, Camp Director &amp; Associate Athletic Director, McDaniel College','$579-$669','day','all','open','','','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-mcdaniel-college',0,0,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T20:19:29.658Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'camp',NULL,NULL,'medium','ussportscamps.com',NULL,'live','2026-05-09T20:19:31.331Z',200,1,0,NULL,NULL);
