eyond skill development, we emphasize character, leadership, and what it means to be a great teammate. This youth soccer camp in Milwaukee provides the perfect balance of high-level coaching and fun, giving players the chance to improve, compete, make friends, and create lasting summer memories. Hear from Men''s Head Coach &amp; Camp Director, David Korn: "Our staff is dedicated to helping each athlete progress to the next level of their game while growing in confidence, character, and love for the sport."','$319-$439','day','all','open','','','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-marquette-university',0,0,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T20:20:47.330Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'camp',NULL,NULL,'medium','ussportscamps.com',NULL,'live','2026-05-09T20:20:49.184Z',200,1,0,NULL,NULL);
