s can learn, grow, and stay cool all week long. Don’t miss your chance to train, play, and splash your way into the best week of the summer! Note: Swim instruction is available exclusively during summer camp weeks. Soccer/swim availability is listed on the schedule for each session.','$299','day','all','open','','','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-swim-camp-hub-sports-windgate-ranch-scottsdale',0,0,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T20:21:24.178Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'camp',NULL,NULL,'medium','ussportscamps.com',NULL,'live','2026-05-09T20:21:25.793Z',200,1,0,NULL,NULL);
