ng, competition, and shared moments, culminating in a full camp tournament. Beyond technical development, the program emphasizes lasting values of character, love of the game, and long‑term growth, helping players develop not just for the week of camp, but for the years ahead. Hear from Camp Director Matt Bambrick: "This isn’t a traditional camp. We use NanoGames and real game-based coaching to develop smarter, more confident players. By focusing on the individual first, every player builds decision-making, connection, and a deeper love for the game. The focus doesn''t stop at your child as a player but also on developing a rounded person. Great people make great players."','$349-$479','day','all','open','','','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-glendale-sports-complex',0,0,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T20:21:37.990Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'camp',NULL,NULL,'medium','ussportscamps.com',NULL,'live','2026-05-09T20:21:39.676Z',200,1,0,NULL,NULL);
