rass fields, shaded waterfront areas perfect for breaks and lunch, and covered spaces ideal for small‑sided games. To help players stay cool and comfortable during the Florida summer, campers will also have access to the Eckerd College pool, providing a refreshing way to beat the heat while keeping the experience fun and safe. Whether your player is just getting started or preparing for higher‑level play, this camp offers a memorable, action‑packed week of development, connection, and growth on the beautiful waterfront campus of Eckerd College. Coach Luke Sheekey and Joe Illet will also be running camps at Admiral Farragut Academy in St. Petersburg! Details can be found HERE','$299-$445','day','all','open','','','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-eckerd-college',0,0,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T20:22:03.168Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'camp',NULL,NULL,'medium','ussportscamps.com',NULL,'live','2026-05-09T20:22:04.759Z',200,1,0,NULL,NULL);
