ng experiences in New England. The overall goal of each training session is to provide technical, tactical, and mental growth while encouraging players to be creative to help them become the most complete version of themselves. "At Next Step Soccer, our camps are built around one simple idea, develop the player, not just the session. Every activity is designed to improve how players think, move, and make decisions in the game, while building confidence and a genuine love for soccer. We create a high-energy, supportive environment where players are challenged, coached with purpose, and leave each day better than they arrived, both on and off the field." - Nick Woodruff, Camp Director &amp; Founder, Next Step Training','$299','day','all','open','','','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-next-step-training-norfolk',0,0,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T20:22:45.688Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'camp',NULL,NULL,'medium','ussportscamps.com',NULL,'live','2026-05-09T20:22:47.346Z',200,1,0,NULL,NULL);
