signed for players ages 10–18, this camp combines elite-level coaching, competitive training, and a fun, supportive atmosphere. It is an unforgettable opportunity for players to improve their game, experience college life, and be part of a positive and inspiring soccer community. Hear from Head Coach and Camp Director Michael O''Neil: “Our residential camp blends elite training with unforgettable fun, giving players a true college-level experience while helping them grow in confidence, connection, and love for the game.”','$489-$589','day','all','open','','','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-girls-soccer-camp-at-niu-collegiate-experience',0,0,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T20:23:14.803Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'camp',NULL,NULL,'medium','ussportscamps.com',NULL,'live','2026-05-09T20:23:16.303Z',200,1,0,NULL,NULL);
