eceives position-specific development. With a fully immersive overnight experience, campers gain a valuable introduction to college life, staying in residence halls, training daily in a structured collegiate environment, and building connections with players from across the region. This experience is ideal for young athletes looking to understand what it takes to compete and succeed at the next level. Open to players ages 8–18, with overnight eligibility beginning at age 9 (8-year-olds are welcome as extended day campers). Coach DiTomasso’s camp was also recognized as one of North America’s Top 60 Summer Camps of 2017 by FlightNetwork travel agency, highlighting its long-standing reputation for quality instruction and player development.','$539-$629','day','all','open','','','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-benedictine-university',0,0,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T20:23:16.687Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'camp',NULL,NULL,'medium','ussportscamps.com',NULL,'live','2026-05-09T20:23:18.297Z',200,1,0,NULL,NULL);
