n extensively on Endicott’s top-tier fields, and participate in structured evening activities that enhance team bonding and personal growth. This overnight format allows players to fully immerse themselves in campus life, build lasting friendships, and develop independence, mirroring the rhythm and expectations of collegiate soccer. In addition, the Coed Day Camp provides a high-energy training option for boys and girls seeking elite instruction without the overnight stay, making it a great fit for younger athletes or local players. Across both camp options, athletes will develop their skills, raise their soccer IQ, and enjoy a week filled with competition, learning, and unforgettable moments. Whether you’re aiming to sharpen your fundamentals or experience what it’s like to train in a true college environment, the Nike Soccer Camp at Endicott College delivers a dynamic and memorable summer soccer experience. “As a player, it was always the people and the experience that made camp special. That’s why our camp is built with a passion for the game and a focus on player development, helping athletes grow their skills, confidence, and a lasting love for the game in a positive, supportive environment.” — Christine Silva, Camp Director and Former Women’s Associate Head Coach, Endicott College','$909','day','all','open','','','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-endicott-college-girls',0,0,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T20:23:21.408Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'camp',NULL,NULL,'medium','ussportscamps.com',NULL,'live','2026-05-09T20:23:23.152Z',200,1,0,NULL,NULL);
