ty facilities, engaging sessions, and a strong emphasis on teamwork and personal growth, campers enjoy a true overnight camp experience, making friends, having fun, and creating lasting memories while developing core soccer fundamentals. "At Next Step Soccer, our camps are built around one simple idea, develop the player, not just the session. Every activity is designed to improve how players think, move, and make decisions in the game, while building confidence and a genuine love for soccer. We create a high-energy, supportive environment where players are challenged, coached with purpose, and leave each day better than they arrived, both on and off the field." - Nick Woodruff, Camp Director &amp; Founder, Next Step Training','$849-$1049','day','all','open','','','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-mount-holyoke',0,0,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T20:23:26.660Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'camp',NULL,NULL,'medium','ussportscamps.com',NULL,'live','2026-05-09T20:23:28.218Z',200,1,0,NULL,NULL);
