ills and techniques. It’s an amazing opportunity for any player to learn from a top coaching professional, enjoy the game, and train in a positive, competitive atmosphere. Soccer Skill Schools'' "Numbers Approach Methodology" brings world-class skill development methods from Brazil, Holland, England, and Spain directly to the Midwest. The Soccer Skill Schools approach focuses on the individual player by guiding each athlete toward complete mastery of the ball, empowering them to make their own creative decisions, and equipping them with 65+ individual skills to win the one-on-one competitions that determine every game''s outcome. Led by experienced college coaches and current college players, the Soccer Skill Schools staff brings elite-level expertise and mentorship to every session. Training alongside coaches who compete at the collegiate level gives players invaluable insight into what it takes to elevate their game and succeed at the next level! Hear from Coach Kyle Jones: “We create an environment where players are challenged, supported, and inspired every day. Through high-quality coaching and a love for the game, our goal is to help each athlete build confidence, develop their skills, and leave camp better both on and off the field.”','$499-$799','day','all','open','','','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-saint-johns-northwestern-academy',0,0,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T20:24:25.311Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'camp',NULL,NULL,'medium','ussportscamps.com',NULL,'live','2026-05-09T20:24:25.555Z',200,1,0,NULL,NULL);
