ompeting, and having fun. What makes this camp truly special is the staff’s commitment to teaching the game the right way, blending proven fundamentals, modern training methods, and an encouraging approach that helps each player grow technically, tactically, and mentally. From dynamic drills to small‑sided games, every session is designed to elevate skills, boost creativity, and inspire a deeper love for the sport. A note from Corey Holton, Associate Women''s Head Coach, Fairfield University: “This isn’t just another camp, it’s a chance to see what the next level is really all about. Players train on a Division I campus, learning from a coaching staff that recruits and develops college athletes, alongside counselors who are currently playing at that level. Led by coaches with over 20 years of collegiate experience, the camp blends focused technical training with fun, competitive games. With a mix of individual ball work, small-sided games, and full-field play when possible, everything is designed to help players grow in confidence, sharpen their skills, and leave with a deeper understanding and love of the game.” Join us this summer at Fairfield University and take your game to the next level with top‑tier coaching, elite facilities, and the trusted Nike Soccer Camp experience!','$389','day','all','open','','','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-girls-soccer-camp-fairfield-university',0,0,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T20:24:36.232Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'camp',NULL,NULL,'medium','ussportscamps.com',NULL,'live','2026-05-09T20:24:36.492Z',200,1,0,NULL,NULL);
