nd decision-making, and develop confidence through high‑energy sessions that blend professionalism with fun. It’s a chance to train like the pros, push your game forward, and experience the intensity and excitement of a true academy-style environment. Whether you''re aiming to elevate your game, build a stronger foundation, or simply enjoy an unforgettable week of soccer, this Nike Soccer Camp is the perfect opportunity to take your skills to the next level.','$265-$375','day','all','open','','','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-sofive-elkins-park',0,0,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T20:33:44.189Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'camp',NULL,NULL,'medium','ussportscamps.com',NULL,'live','2026-05-09T20:33:46.086Z',200,1,0,NULL,NULL);
