 day camper or staying overnight, participants benefit from a positive, challenging environment designed to accelerate player growth, build confidence, and inspire a lasting love for the game.','$489','day','all','open','','','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-william-jessup-university',0,0,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T20:33:48.155Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'camp',NULL,NULL,'medium','ussportscamps.com',NULL,'live','2026-05-09T20:33:49.921Z',200,1,0,NULL,NULL);
