tically, physically, and mentally, while training alongside peers in a positive, motivating, and inclusive environment. Don’t miss this one-of-a-kind opportunity for game-changing development, and unforgettable soccer memories!','$335','day','all','open','','','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-north-haven',0,0,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T20:35:14.806Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'camp',NULL,NULL,'medium','ussportscamps.com',NULL,'live','2026-05-09T20:35:16.628Z',200,1,0,NULL,NULL);
