he sun, and nearby portable restrooms ensure comfort and convenience for all. Join us for a week filled with new friends, inspiring coaches, and unforgettable memories, all while taking your game to the next level!','$359-$489','day','all','open','','','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-haverhill-ma',0,0,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T20:36:33.913Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'camp',NULL,NULL,'medium','ussportscamps.com',NULL,'live','2026-05-09T20:36:34.202Z',200,1,0,NULL,NULL);
