mselves each and every day. This unforgettable soccer training experience helps players elevate confidence, character, and performance while advancing to new heights in soccer excellence. Hear from Camp Director Daniel Carroll: "PhiloSoccer camps are about more than soccer! We believe a true sports camp should deliver and teach players all of the many life skills that the game has to offer, through: challenge, discipline, teamwork, self-expression, adversity, creativity and sportsmanship. Our curriculum is designed to teach fundamental to advanced soccer skills and techniques but also help players shine and step into the best versions of themselves each and every day."','$295-$399','day','all','open','','','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-takoma-park-md',0,0,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T20:36:47.004Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'camp',NULL,NULL,'medium','ussportscamps.com',NULL,'live','2026-05-09T20:36:48.897Z',200,1,0,NULL,NULL);
