ling summer soccer programs, secure your spot before it sells out again!','$525','day','all','open','','','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-windward-school',0,0,'pending','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T20:39:04.685Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'camp',NULL,NULL,'medium','ussportscamps.com',NULL,'live','2026-05-09T20:39:06.248Z',200,0,0,NULL,NULL);
