fers a central and convenient setting for families throughout the region. Hear from Coach Gemar Lezeau: "Our camp is built around creating a professional, positive environment where players are challenged to improve every day. We focus on developing technical ability, game understanding, and confidence on the ball through structured, game-based training. At the same time, we make sure players enjoy the process, competing, learning, and growing in a safe and supportive setting that builds both skill and a lasting love for the game."','$365-$485','day','all','open','','','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-costa-mesa-orange-county',0,0,'pending','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T20:39:23.256Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'camp',NULL,NULL,'medium','ussportscamps.com',NULL,'live','2026-05-09T20:39:24.964Z',200,0,0,NULL,NULL);
