nd high‑level performance. Whether you''re looking to improve your technical foundation, sharpen your tactical awareness, or challenge yourself in a competitive setting, this camp delivers an unforgettable training experience. Don’t miss your chance to learn from one of the most influential training methods in global soccer.','$280-$399','day','all','open','','','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-maryland-soccerplex-boyds-md',0,0,'pending','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T20:42:40.558Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'camp',NULL,NULL,'medium','ussportscamps.com',NULL,'live','2026-05-09T20:42:40.871Z',200,0,0,NULL,NULL);
