oung athlete can grow at the right pace. A fun and engaging 90‑minute daily camp for ages 4–5, introducing kids to the joy of soccer through movement‑based activities, foundation‑building skills, and an encouraging atmosphere. For players ages 6–14, the half‑day camp delivers a dynamic progression of fast‑paced drills, technical development, small‑sided games, and gameplay‑focused learning that challenges athletes to sharpen technique, expand their soccer IQ, and play with creativity and purpose. Each session is carefully designed to keep campers active, engaged, and motivated from start to finish. With top‑tier coaching from JM Soccer Academy and the proven structure and excitement of Nike Soccer Camps, this program delivers one of the most complete and inspiring soccer experiences in the Henderson/Las Vegas area. Join us this summer and take your game to the next level with elite coaching and nonstop fun!','$150-$270','day','all','open','','','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-jm-soccer-academy-henderson-nv',0,0,'pending','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T20:49:15.127Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'camp',NULL,NULL,'medium','ussportscamps.com',NULL,'live','2026-05-09T20:49:16.835Z',200,0,0,NULL,NULL);
