ynamic training curriculum featuring technical skill‑building, attacking and defending concepts, small‑sided games, ball mastery work, and competitive match play, all delivered with the enthusiasm and structure Nike Soccer Camps are known for. Surrounded by premier facilities and a fun, encouraging atmosphere, players build confidence, improve soccer IQ, and experience meaningful growth throughout the week. Join us this summer at the University of Hartford and take your game to new heights with elite coaching, incredible facilities, and an unforgettable soccer experience!','$319-$439','day','all','open','','','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-university-hartford',0,0,'pending','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T21:17:00.037Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'camp',NULL,NULL,'medium','ussportscamps.com',NULL,'live','2026-05-09T21:17:01.553Z',200,0,0,NULL,NULL);
