 option that blends collegiate-level expertise with the trusted Nike camp structure. The result is an engaging, safe, and motivating environment where players can grow their skills, compete, and develop a lifelong love for the game.','$275-$385','day','all','open','','','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-la-salle-university-philadelphia',0,0,'pending','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T21:39:19.467Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'camp',NULL,NULL,'medium','ussportscamps.com',NULL,'live','2026-05-09T21:39:21.356Z',200,0,0,NULL,NULL);
