ance their skill set, and have fun doing it. Don’t miss your chance to train like a champion this summer, sign up for the Nike Soccer Camp at The Lovett School and take your game to the next level!','$499','day','all','open','','','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-lovett-school',0,0,'pending','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T21:39:25.231Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'camp',NULL,NULL,'medium','ussportscamps.com',NULL,'live','2026-05-09T21:39:26.748Z',200,0,0,NULL,NULL);
