idence. Whether your child is new to soccer or striving to reach an elite level, they’ll leave camp with improved skills, new friendships, and a passion for the game!','$270','day','all','open','','','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-solano-surf-fairfield',0,0,'pending','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T21:39:27.126Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'camp',NULL,NULL,'medium','ussportscamps.com',NULL,'live','2026-05-09T21:39:28.928Z',200,0,0,NULL,NULL);
